{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13004","headline":"答李滁州见寄 · 独孤及","name":"答李滁州见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相逢遽叹别离牵，三见江臯惠草鲜。\n白发俱生欢未再，沧州独往意何坚。\n愁看郡内花将歇，忍过山中月屡圆。\n终日望君休汝骑，愧无堪报起予篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}